Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.02,0:01:26.22,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k78}Gǔn{\k46}gǔn {\k52}cháng{\k53}jiāng {\k111}dōng{\k129}shì{\k448}shuǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.02,0:01:26.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}On and on the Great River rolls, racing east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:35.42,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k61}Làng{\k69}huā {\k117}táo{\k107}jǐn {\k105}yīng{\k464}xióng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:35.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}Of proud and gallant heroes its white-waves leave no trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:44.54,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k67}Shì{\k111}fēi {\k76}chéng{\k104}bài {\k129}zhuǎn{\k242}tóu{\k195}kōng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:44.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}As right and wrong, glory and fall,\N fade at once into unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.66,0:01:48.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k69}Qīng{\k63}shān {\k40}yī{\k80}jiù {\k175}zài
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.66,0:01:48.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}Yet ever the green hills stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:54.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k85}Jǐ{\k78}dù {\k58}xī{\k64}yáng{\k271}hóng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:54.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}to blaze in the west-waning day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:10.42,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k52}Bái{\k71}fà {\k96}yú{\k195}qiáo {\k109}jiāng{\k116}zhǔ {\k193}shàng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:10.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}Fishers and woodsmen comb on the river isles,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:18.30,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k50}Guàn{\k46}kàn {\k102}qiū{\k103}yuè {\k166}chūn{\k313}fēng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:18.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}White-crowned, looking on \Nthe autumn moons and spring breezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:26.86,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k74}Yī{\k124}hú {\k120}zhuó{\k114}jiǔ {\k64}xǐ{\k167}xiāng{\k177}féng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:26.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}With a jar of wine, they merrily gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:29.82,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k38}Gǔ{\k64}jīn {\k48}duō{\k70}shǎo {\k60}shì
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:29.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}The countless tales of present and past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:40.66,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k56}Duō{\k68}fù {\k518}xiào {\k127}tán {\k316}zhōng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:40.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord6}all in their jests.
